    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_15",
      "hash64": "F1C0A598E7E14815",
      "text": "¡Expresa tristeza! ¡Con esa vocecilla casi hace\\nque se me salten las lágrimas![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_16",
      "hash64": "F1C0A298E7E142FC",
      "text": "Evidentemente, Pikachu no está triste de verdad.\\n¡Simplemente tiene un don para el dramatismo![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_17",
      "hash64": "F1C0A398E7E144AF",
      "text": "Se ha ganado un merecido aplauso por tan\\nbrillante actuación, ¿no creéis?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_d_06_popup_01",
      "hash64": "E5F5735549382D14",
      "text": "¡Plas, plas, plas!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_18",
      "hash64": "F1C0A898E7E14D2E",
      "text": "Y ahora, mis queridos amantes de las palabras,\\n¡ha llegado el momento del consejo de hoy![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_19",
      "hash64": "F1C0A998E7E14EE1",
      "text": "La única forma de responder a la tristeza es con\\namabilidad. ¡Sed amables con vuestros Pokémon\\r\\ncuando estén afligidos![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_20",
      "hash64": "F1BD3A98E7DE5C6D",
      "text": "Aunque eso no hace falta decirlo, ¿verdad?\\nDe mis alumnos favoritos no esperaría otra cosa.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_21",
      "hash64": "F1BD3998E7DE5ABA",
      "text": "Y, como todo en esta vida, la lección de hoy no\\nse limita solo a los Pokémon.\\c\\nSi veis a alguien con cara larga, como uno de\\nvuestros compañeros, ¡responded con gentileza![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 173,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_22",
      "hash64": "F1BD3898E7DE5907",
      "text": "Cuando nos asola la tristeza es cuando más falta\\nnos hacen las palabras amables de otra persona.\\c\\n¡Espero poder veros siempre con una sonrisa en\\nla cara, my friends![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 167,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "class_d_06_language_23",
      "hash64": "F1BD3798E7DE5754",
      "text": "Y, con todo el pesar de mi corazón, me temo que\\nla próxima lección será la última.\\c\\n¡Espero que vengáis cargados de ilusión para\\neste gran final! Bye-bye, sayōnara![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
